WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.569
F2.1 · Users and roles

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.785
Every user has one of four roles.

3
00:00:07.835 --> 00:00:10.296
Owner, admin, editor or viewer.

4
00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:20.028
Give each person the access their job needs, and no more.

5
00:00:20.078 --> 00:00:22.030
Keep owners and admins few.

6
00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.695
One login per person, removed the day they leave.

7
00:00:28.745 --> 00:00:32.790
Review roles every quarter; access grows, it rarely shrinks.

8
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:40.637
An LLM acts through the builder pass, with the builder's rights, never through someone else's account.

9
00:00:42.087 --> 00:00:45.987
Next: F2.2  Governance approvers and dual control

